ust it doesn't change the  dynamic but it's always funny to meet  somebody that's a lot older than you  that you have more I don't know in a way  you know he learns for me I learn from  him it's a really it's a really good  process it's always nice to have someone  around that's not up all the time like a  lot of the people on the cast so yeah  I only imagine the type of drama that  goes on we've had a few tequila nights  with Frankie where I'm just sitting  there like get me out of here  I know people are asking you about your  parents we saw your mom in the trailer  it's been a year though since you and  your dad really made headlines it sounds  like you guys are in a great place  though you've said you're in a good  place how much of that relationship will  we see this season I mean that's  something I've tried to keep private  between me and my dad but there's it's  definitely you know it's inevitable that  that spills over onto my show and it was  a big part of my life it was something  that was really prevalent in my life at  the time and during most of the filming  process so I think you get to see a  little bit of that and it's definitely a  hard time for both of us how is he gonna  feel watching it back I don't know I  feel like I was pretty angry when we  were filming so I don't remember what I  said which is like kind of  nerve-wracking to Bob I try to tell me  I'm like dude I don't know if I said  anything crazy but who knows you know I  was really upset when all that stuff was  going on but you know you know friends  fight he's one of my best he's like my  best friend so people get over it did  you sort of sit your parents down and  say okay so here's what I think might be  happening here's what I don't know is  gonna happen  no because I have no idea what's gonna  happen and I haven't told anybody I'm  like listen it could just be whatever I  have no I have no idea have no control  you know people added things certain  ways and whatever is it most inte